# Comparative Genome Analysis of Different Bacteria

## Overview

This project performs a basic comparative genome analysis using Python.

The program:

- Reads bacterial genome sequences from FASTA files.
- Calculates genome length.
- Computes GC content.
- Counts nucleotides (A, T, G, C).
- Exports the comparison as a CSV file.

## Technologies

- Python
- Pandas

